  "description": "Structured document analyzers for the Shiny CameraView and MediaElement — each document type (Invoice, Receipt, BusinessCard, DriversLicense, HealthCard, CreditCard, Passport) is its own analyzer with a strongly-typed event. Driver's licenses (AAMVA PDF417), passports (MRZ) and credit cards (IIN + Luhn) are parsed deterministically; invoices/receipts/business cards/health cards via OCR + swappable rules.",
